{
  "domain": "活动报名",
  "document": "美团报名",
  "modules": [
    {
      "title": "数据采集总览",
      "summary": "页面顶部的「数据采集」分区：按当前业务日核对美团活动目录（神价清单）数据源是否就绪，支持手动补采，并提示毛利参数是否已签认。",
      "content_md": "# 数据采集总览（美团报名）\n\n## 业务逻辑\n\n美团报名页顶部的「数据采集」分区，帮运营在开工前回答一个问题：今天的美团活动目录数据齐了没有。\n\n- 就绪核对：按当前业务日核对美团神价清单数据源是否就绪；摘要行汇总就绪数量与业务日，未就绪时可展开明细查看服务端给出的原因说明。\n- 手动补采：未就绪的数据源可点「重新采集」发起当日后台补采；受理后行内提示已入队，并轮询总览刷新状态。淘宝已报名对账补采必须附活动 ID，美团来源不需要。\n- 参数口径：同时读取当前毛利参数状态，参数未签认（或读不到）时分区标题旁显示「收益依据待确认」标记，提醒当前收益为预览口径。\n- 活动快照：总览附带各活动的类型、起止时间、报名截止、商品数与价格/补贴上限，供运营参考；但目录可读不代表报名资格，最终资格由实时候选读取决定。\n\n## API\n\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/overview` — 报名总览：业务日、活动快照、数据源完备性与参数口径状态。\n- `POST /api/v2/signup/source-collections/{dataset}/run` — 对指定数据源发起当日补采。\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/margin-params/current` — 当前生效毛利参数，驱动“收益依据待确认”标记。",
      "nfr_md": "- 补采受理后按 3 秒间隔轮询总览刷新数据源状态，刷新一轮即停止（代码证据：`sourceCollectionRefreshPolling` intervalMs=3000）。\n- 总览、参数等首屏请求带 `background` 标记走后台加载，不触发全屏加载遮罩（代码证据；推测旨在避免白屏）。",
      "apis": [
        {
          "name": "报名总览",
          "api": "GET /api/v2/signup/overview",
          "request": [],
          "response": [
            { "name": "businessDate", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "服务端按上海时区给出的当前业务日", "children": [] },
            {
              "name": "activities", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "活动快照目录（目录可读不代表当前报名资格）",
              "children": [
                { "name": "platform", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "平台，如 meituan / taobao", "children": [] },
                { "name": "activityId", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "活动 ID", "children": [] },
                { "name": "activityName", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "活动名称", "children": [] },
                { "name": "activityType", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "活动类型，如 神价", "children": [] },
                { "name": "startTime", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "活动开始时间（ISO）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "endTime", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "活动结束时间（ISO）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "signupDeadline", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "报名截止时间，确认预检的时间判定基准", "children": [] },
                { "name": "itemCount", "type": "integer", "required": false, "description": "活动商品数", "children": [] },
                { "name": "priceCap", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "活动价格上限（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "subsidyCap", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "活动补贴上限（元）", "children": [] }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "datasets", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "数据源完备性（美团页签只展示 meituan_shenge_activities）",
              "children": [
                { "name": "dataset", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "数据源标识，如 meituan_shenge_activities", "children": [] },
                { "name": "status", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "present=当日已就绪，其余为未就绪", "children": [] },
                { "name": "businessDate", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "该数据源对应的业务日", "children": [] },
                { "name": "detail", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "未就绪原因说明", "children": [] }
              ]
            },
            { "name": "paramsStatus", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "毛利参数状态：preview/signed/null，驱动“预览口径，待签认”标记", "children": [] },
            { "name": "paramsRevision", "type": "integer", "required": false, "description": "当前参数版本号", "children": [] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "数据源补采",
          "api": "POST /api/v2/signup/source-collections/{dataset}/run",
          "request": [
            { "name": "dataset", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "路径参数：meituan_shenge_activities / taobao_signup_activities / taobao_signup_enrolled", "children": [] },
            { "name": "businessDate", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "补采业务日（取自总览 businessDate）", "children": [] },
            { "name": "activityId", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "活动 ID；仅淘宝已报名对账补采必须携带数字活动 ID", "children": [] }
          ],
          "response": [
            { "name": "runId", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "采集任务运行号", "children": [] },
            { "name": "status", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "任务状态：queued/running/succeeded/failed/blocked", "children": [] },
            { "name": "businessDate", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "任务业务日", "children": [] },
            { "name": "message", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "受理说明，如“已进入后台采集队列”", "children": [] },
            { "name": "errorCode", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "失败业务码", "children": [] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "当前毛利参数",
          "api": "GET /api/v2/signup/margin-params/current",
          "request": [],
          "response": [
            { "name": "revision", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "参数版本号", "children": [] },
            { "name": "status", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "preview=预览待签认 / signed=已签认", "children": [] },
            { "name": "formulaId", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "公式标识，如 v1_basic", "children": [] },
            {
              "name": "params", "type": "object", "required": true, "description": "参数载荷（snake_case，界面只消费 status/revision）",
              "children": [
                { "name": "commission_base", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "扣点基数：original_price / activity_price", "children": [] },
                { "name": "commission_rate", "type": "object", "required": true, "description": "分平台扣点率，如 { taobao: \"0.06\", meituan: \"0.06\" }", "children": [] },
                { "name": "profit_denominator", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "利润率分母：activity_price / receivable_price", "children": [] },
                { "name": "conservative_subsidy_assumption", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "保守补贴假设值，null 表示按零补贴", "children": [] }
              ]
            },
            { "name": "signedAt", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "签认时间；未签认为 null", "children": [] }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "候选商品筛选与读取",
      "summary": "美团页签按“活动 → 商品组 → 门店”实时分批读取当前可报名候选，支持继续读取、成本准备中自动续读与收益区间本地筛选。",
      "content_md": "# 候选商品筛选与读取（美团报名）\n\n## 业务逻辑\n\n美团页签不走历史清单，而是按“活动 → 商品组 → 门店”实时读取当前可报名候选，保证看到的就是此刻能报的。\n\n- 范围选择：页面打开时读取服务端采集的父活动目录供多选（不代表当前报名资格）；选中活动后读官方当前子活动目录，前端翻页直到读全，分页不连贯（缺页、重复等）直接报错，不容忍半截目录。\n- 商品组口径：只有当前可报名、或带日采商品提示（标注“待当前核验”）的子活动才纳入读取范围；商品组不做手选，始终全选当前可读项。目录刷新否定旧商品组后，旧的候选、勾选与报价预览全部作废重读。\n- 门店口径：门店来自正式门店对照，仅平台门店 ID 为纯数字的算美团有效门店，默认全选。\n- 分批读取：按 活动×商品组×门店 组合小批量分页读取，摘要行显示读取进度；未读完时提供「继续读取」，绝不把尚未读取的门店当作空结果。每批候选带报价有效期，确认时由系统再次核对。\n- 成本准备中：服务端返回“成本准备中”业务码时，页面提示并定时自动续读，直到准备完成。\n- 候选状态：候选行分为可填写、成本准备中、无成本、不可报名四类；数据异常的行一律按不可报名处理，绝不形成可确认目标。\n- 收益区间筛选：利润率与利润额区间在前端本地过滤已读取的候选，下限大于上限会被拦截；「查询」按当前勾选重读候选，「重置」回到默认范围。\n\n## API\n\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-activities` — 服务端采集的父活动目录（含日采商品组提示）。\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-subactivities` — 官方当前子活动目录。\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-candidates` — 按活动+商品组+门店分页读取实时美团候选（只读）。",
      "nfr_md": "- 候选读取每批最多 4 个门店范围、并发 2 路、每页 20 条，控制对平台实时接口的压力（代码证据：`LIVE_STORE_READ_BATCH_SIZE=4`、`withReadConcurrency` 并发 2、`pageSize: 20`）。\n- 成本准备中（`signup_candidate_preparing`）时按 15 秒间隔自动续读（代码证据：`livePreparationPolling` intervalMs=15000）。\n- 子活动目录固定 10 条/页，前端全量翻页并校验页码连续性（代码证据）。",
      "apis": [
        {
          "name": "父活动目录",
          "api": "GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-activities",
          "request": [
            { "name": "page", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "页码（页面固定请求 page=1, pageSize=100）", "children": [] },
            { "name": "pageSize", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "每页条数", "children": [] }
          ],
          "response": [
            { "name": "page", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "当前页码", "children": [] },
            { "name": "total", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "活动总数", "children": [] },
            {
              "name": "items", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "父活动范围列表",
              "children": [
                { "name": "activityId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "活动 ID（数字）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "name", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "活动名称", "children": [] },
                {
                  "name": "directoryHintSubActivities", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "日采活动商品提示，仅缩短候选读取启动等待，不代表当前 online 或可报名",
                  "children": [
                    { "name": "subActId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "子活动（商品组）ID", "children": [] },
                    { "name": "name", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "日采 SKU 的真实商品名；缺失时不作为可选提示", "children": [] }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "子活动目录",
          "api": "GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-subactivities",
          "request": [
            { "name": "activityId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "父活动 ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "page", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "页码；接口固定 10 条/页", "children": [] }
          ],
          "response": [
            { "name": "activityId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "父活动 ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "activityName", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "父活动名称", "children": [] },
            { "name": "total", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "子活动总数", "children": [] },
            { "name": "scopeComplete", "type": "boolean", "required": true, "description": "范围是否完整", "children": [] },
            {
              "name": "items", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "官方当前目录的 online 子活动",
              "children": [
                { "name": "subActId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "子活动（商品组）ID", "children": [] },
                { "name": "name", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "子活动名称", "children": [] },
                { "name": "canApply", "type": "boolean", "required": true, "description": "当前是否可报名；最终资格仍在服务端候选读取时复核", "children": [] }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "实时美团候选分页",
          "api": "GET /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-candidates",
          "request": [
            { "name": "activityId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "活动 ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "subActId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "子活动（商品组）ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "storeKey", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "门店键（与门店对照共用 storeKey）", "children": [] },
            { "name": "page", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "页码", "children": [] },
            { "name": "pageSize", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "每页条数，服务端上限 20", "children": [] }
          ],
          "response": [
            { "name": "activityId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "活动 ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "subActId", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "子活动 ID", "children": [] },
            { "name": "storeKey", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "门店键", "children": [] },
            { "name": "storeName", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "门店名称", "children": [] },
            { "name": "total", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "该范围候选总数", "children": [] },
            { "name": "scopeComplete", "type": "boolean", "required": true, "description": "范围读取是否完整", "children": [] },
            { "name": "expiresAt", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "本批报价有效期；确认时系统再次核对", "children": [] },
            {
              "name": "items", "type": "array", "required": true, "description": "候选商品列表（金额字段以字符串序列化，归一化为 number）",
              "children": [
                { "name": "state", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "候选状态：needs_inputs / cost_pending / no_cost / unavailable", "children": [] },
                { "name": "reason", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "不可报名原因说明", "children": [] },
                { "name": "candidateSnapshotId", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "服务端冻结的候选唯一身份（UUID）；确认时唯一回传标识", "children": [] },
                { "name": "barcode", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "商品条码", "children": [] },
                { "name": "skuCode", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "平台 SKU 编码", "children": [] },
                { "name": "productName", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "商品名称", "children": [] },
                { "name": "spec", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "规格", "children": [] },
                { "name": "originalPrice", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "零售原价（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "priceMin", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "当前可报价格下限（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "priceMax", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "当前可报价格上限（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "cost", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "门店成本（元）；null=未取得，不冒充零", "children": [] },
                { "name": "stockMin", "type": "integer", "required": false, "description": "当前可售库存下限；与 stockMax 构成正整数闭区间才可用于报名", "children": [] },
                { "name": "stockMax", "type": "integer", "required": false, "description": "当前可售库存上限", "children": [] },
                { "name": "commissionAmount", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "平台扣点金额（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "receivablePrice", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "预计到手价（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "absoluteProfit", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "利润额（元）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "marginRate", "type": "number", "required": false, "description": "利润率（百分数，40=40%）", "children": [] },
                { "name": "advice", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "引擎建议：recommend / review / skip；无建议为 null", "children": [] }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "报名商品表与试算",
      "summary": "实时候选投影进统一报名商品表：成本三态与行级可报名判定、改价自动服务端试算、补贴证据查询与智能报价优化。",
      "content_md": "# 报名商品表与试算（美团报名）\n\n## 业务逻辑\n\n读取到的实时候选投影进统一的「报名商品」表，运营在这里改价、试算收益、查补贴证据、生成报价建议。\n\n- 成本三态：成本分已匹配、采集中（会随成本补齐自动消除）、无此商品成本（不会消除）三种；未匹配的行不能编辑也不能勾选，成本与利润如实显示状态——“不知道”不冒充零。\n- 行级可报名判定：只有候选可填写、当前可售库存可信、可报价格范围已核实、原价有效且成本已匹配的行才可编辑勾选；不满足的行在报名状态列给出原因提示。勾选有单次上限，跨页勾选保留。\n- 改价试算：修改申报价后自动调用服务端试算，试算按保守零补贴口径回显到手价、利润与建议（符合利润要求 / 需要复核 / 不建议）；改了价但未完成试算的商品不能进入确认。\n- 补贴展示与查询：补贴列只展示证据（上限、历史值或“未取得”），均不代表实际补贴；补贴依据查询同样只回证据与实时探针状态，页面明确提示“实际补贴未知，不以此视为实收”。\n- 报价优化（智能探测）：对单个候选请求报价优化前，页面先重读该候选所在页核对身份，身份或活动范围已变化则中止并要求重新查看；探测返回逐价样本与选中方案，选中的合格报价自动回填申报价并触发试算，无合格方案时明确告知。（推测：该入口经由表格事件接线，组件已声明相应事件与展示数据。）\n\n## API\n\n- `POST /api/v2/signup/margin-params/evaluate` — 按当前毛利参数试算单个拟报名价的收益。\n- `GET /api/v2/signup/subsidy-lookup` — 只读补贴证据查询（上限/历史值，不等同实际补贴）。\n- `POST /api/v2/signup/meituan/live-candidates/{candidateId}/optimize` — 对实时候选做多轮报价探测，返回选中报价与逐价样本。",
      "nfr_md": "- 改价后自动触发试算，请求带 `background+silent`；以版本号保证只有“当前价格、当前范围”的那次结果写回（代码证据：`trialVersions`/`trialSequence` 校验）。\n- 表格分页 20/50/100 可选，页面默认每页 50 条（代码证据：`pageSize` 默认 50）。\n- 报价优化前先重读候选所在页核对身份，避免按过期快照报价（代码证据：`refreshLiveCandidate`；推测用于控制误报风险）。",
      "apis": [
        {
          "name": "收益试算",
